7. Пробуем через python request
nano get_request.py

import requests

url = "http://localhost:3000/#/search"
params = {
        "q": "banana"
}

headers = {
        "Accept": "application/json"
}

cookies = {
        "language": "en"
}

response = requests.get(
        url,
        params=params,
        headers=headers,
        cookies=cookies
)

print("URL:", response.url)
print("status code:", response.status_code)

main_headers = [
        "Content-Type",
        "Contetnt-Lenght",
        "Connection"
]

for name in main_headers:
        if name in response.headers:
                print(f"{name}: {response.headers[name]}")

запускаем python3 get_request.py
Получаем:
URL: http://localhost:3000/?q=banana#/search
status code: 200
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8
Connection: keep-alive

8. POST request через Python
nano post_requests.py
import requests

url = "http://localhost:3000/#/login"

headers = {
        "Accept": "application/json",
        "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0>
}

body = {
        "email": "test@test.com",
        "password": "12345"
}

response = requests.post(
        url,
        headers=headers,
        json=body
)

print("URL:", response.url)
print("Status code:", response.status_code)

for name in [
        "Content-Type",
        "Contetnt-Lenght",
        "User-Agent",
        "Connection",
        "Set-Cookie",
]:
        if name in response.headers:
                print(f"{name}: {response.headers[name]}")

Запускаем python3 post_requests.py
Получаем:
URL: http://localhost:3000/#/login
Status code: 200
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8
Connection: keep-alive

